# Repomix — generated file, too large for project
repomix-output.xml

# Root-level /verification/ artifacts are handled by the consolidated block below
# (`verification/*` + explicit re-include negations). The former standalone
# `/verification/` directory-exclude was removed 2026-06-04 — a directory-exclude
# blocks re-inclusion of any child, which silently broke the a11y/e4/mobile/atlas
# negations (atlas baseline needed a force-add). `verification/*` is root-anchored
# (mid-slash), so scripts/verification/ stays tracked.

